<P align=center> </P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 19.2pt; TEXT-ALIGN: left; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; mso-pagination: widow-orphan" align=left><FONT size=3><SPAN lang=EN-US style="COLOR: #3e3e3e; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; mso-bidi-font-family: Helvetica; mso-font-kerning: 0pt"> 7</SPAN><SPAN style="COLOR: #3e3e3e; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; mso-bidi-font-family: Helvetica; mso-font-kerning: 0pt">月<SPAN lang=EN-US>30</SPAN>日，我校暑期美国海外交流访学团圆满完成了学习任务，带着满满的收获和喜悦回到了绍兴。这次美国访学之行的收获，也许并非显而易见，但这些收获将对我们今后的学习生活产生潜移默化的影响，并使我们受益终生。</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #3e3e3e; FONT-FAMILY: Helvetica; mso-font-kerning: 0pt"><?xml:namespace prefix = o ns = "urn:schemas-microsoft-com:office:office" /><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 19.2pt; TEXT-ALIGN: left; mso-pagination: widow-orphan" align=left><SPAN style="BORDER-RIGHT: windowtext 1pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 0cm; BORDER-TOP: windowtext 1pt; PADDING-LEFT: 0cm; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; BACKGROUND: #f54242; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; BORDER-LEFT: windowtext 1pt; COLOR: white; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; BORDER-BOTTOM: windowtext 1pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: Helvetica; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: inherit; mso-hansi-font-family: inherit; mso-border-alt: none windowtext 0cm">感受一：</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="BORDER-RIGHT: windowtext 1pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 0cm; BORDER-TOP: windowtext 1pt; PADDING-LEFT: 0cm; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; BACKGROUND: #f54242; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; BORDER-LEFT: windowtext 1pt; COLOR: white; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; BORDER-BOTTOM: windowtext 1pt; FONT-FAMILY: inherit; mso-bidi-font-family: Helvetica; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-border-alt: none windowtext 0cm"><FONT face=Calibri>“</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="BORDER-RIGHT: windowtext 1pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 0cm; BORDER-TOP: windowtext 1pt; PADDING-LEFT: 0cm; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; BACKGROUND: #f54242; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; BORDER-LEFT: windowtext 1pt; COLOR: white; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; BORDER-BOTTOM: windowtext 1pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: Helvetica; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: inherit; mso-hansi-font-family: inherit; mso-border-alt: none windowtext 0cm">教育即生活</SPAN><FONT face=Calibri><SPAN lang=EN-US style="BORDER-RIGHT: windowtext 1pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 0cm; BORDER-TOP: windowtext 1pt; PADDING-LEFT: 0cm; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; BACKGROUND: #f54242; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; BORDER-LEFT: windowtext 1pt; COLOR: white; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; BORDER-BOTTOM: windowtext 1pt; FONT-FAMILY: inherit; mso-bidi-font-family: Helvetica; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-border-alt: none windowtext 0cm">”</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #3e3e3e; FONT-FAMILY: Helvetica; mso-bidi-font-family: Helvetica; mso-font-kerning: 0pt"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 19.2pt; TEXT-ALIGN: left; mso-pagination: widow-orphan" align=left><FONT size=3><SPAN lang=EN-US style="COLOR: #3e3e3e; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; mso-bidi-font-family: Helvetica; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 宋体"><FONT face=Calibri> </FONT></SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="COLOR: #3e3e3e; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; mso-bidi-font-family: Helvetica; mso-font-kerning: 0pt"><SPAN style="mso-spacerun: yes">    </SPAN></SPAN><SPAN style="COLOR: #3e3e3e; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; mso-bidi-font-family: Helvetica; mso-font-kerning: 0pt">我们感受最深的是美国国民的良好素质。当他们不小心碰到他人或需要借过时，都会轻声说“<SPAN lang=EN-US>Excuse me.</SPAN>”；获得他人的帮助，哪怕只是给你递点东西，或帮你拉开门，人们都会说“<SPAN lang=EN-US>Thank you.</SPAN>”；公共餐桌上用餐结束，学生们都会自觉清扫垃圾并把餐盘放回原位；在美国的十字路口，司机们会远远地停下等你穿越马路，也看不到司机间争道抢行，到处都是一幅和谐的景象；无论在学校门口，还是在走廊上或在教学楼某个角落，你所遇到的每个问题都会被耐心地解答，不会有人表示出丝毫的不耐烦。在加菲尔德的课外活动中，学校当地消防负责人引导学生如何熟悉社区环境，预先找寻并制定地震、火灾等突发事件中的逃生和汇合路线；从快餐文化课上同学们学会了如何按比例制作三文治、比萨饼……学习和教育皆来源于生活，并运用于生活。</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #3e3e3e; FONT-FAMILY: Helvetica; mso-bidi-font-family: Helvetica; mso-font-kerning: 0pt"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 19.2pt; TEXT-ALIGN: left; mso-pagination: widow-orphan" align=left><SPAN style="BORDER-RIGHT: windowtext 1pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 0cm; BORDER-TOP: windowtext 1pt; PADDING-LEFT: 0cm; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; BACKGROUND: #f54242; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; BORDER-LEFT: windowtext 1pt; COLOR: white; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; BORDER-BOTTOM: windowtext 1pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: Helvetica; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: inherit; mso-hansi-font-family: inherit; mso-border-alt: none windowtext 0cm">感受二：</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="BORDER-RIGHT: windowtext 1pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 0cm; BORDER-TOP: windowtext 1pt; PADDING-LEFT: 0cm; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; BACKGROUND: #f54242; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; BORDER-LEFT: windowtext 1pt; COLOR: white; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; BORDER-BOTTOM: windowtext 1pt; FONT-FAMILY: inherit; mso-bidi-font-family: Helvetica; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-border-alt: none windowtext 0cm"><FONT face=Calibri>“</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="BORDER-RIGHT: windowtext 1pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 0cm; BORDER-TOP: windowtext 1pt; PADDING-LEFT: 0cm; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; BACKGROUND: #f54242; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; BORDER-LEFT: windowtext 1pt; COLOR: white; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; BORDER-BOTTOM: windowtext 1pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: Helvetica; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: inherit; mso-hansi-font-family: inherit; mso-border-alt: none windowtext 0cm">且玩且学习</SPAN><FONT face=Calibri><SPAN lang=EN-US style="BORDER-RIGHT: windowtext 1pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 0cm; BORDER-TOP: windowtext 1pt; PADDING-LEFT: 0cm; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; BACKGROUND: #f54242; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; BORDER-LEFT: windowtext 1pt; COLOR: white; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; BORDER-BOTTOM: windowtext 1pt; FONT-FAMILY: inherit; mso-bidi-font-family: Helvetica; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-border-alt: none windowtext 0cm">”</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #3e3e3e; FONT-FAMILY: Helvetica; mso-bidi-font-family: Helvetica; mso-font-kerning: 0pt"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 19.2pt; TEXT-ALIGN: left; mso-pagination: widow-orphan" align=left><FONT size=3><SPAN lang=EN-US style="COLOR: #3e3e3e; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; mso-bidi-font-family: Helvetica; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 宋体"><FONT face=Calibri> </FONT></SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="COLOR: #3e3e3e; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; mso-bidi-font-family: Helvetica; mso-font-kerning: 0pt"><SPAN style="mso-spacerun: yes">    </SPAN></SPAN><SPAN style="COLOR: #3e3e3e; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; mso-bidi-font-family: Helvetica; mso-font-kerning: 0pt">在美国的课堂，学生很随意，在不影响课堂秩序的情况下，学生甚至可以自由出入。但是课堂教学小而精，十分重视师生互动，每个学生都能得到老师足够的关注与爱护。学生上课轻松愉悦，<SPAN lang=EN-US>85</SPAN>分钟的课堂晃眼就过去了。当中国的学生还在严肃紧张的课堂氛围中学习时，他们的学生却在玩转中学。我们学生和美国学生一起上课，前半段老师授课为主，学习语法、知识，后半段则是以同学之间的互动为主。同学们在这些互动中跟美国学生交流，提高口语水平，锻炼自己即时组织语言的能力。美国课堂设计与社会实践活动密切相融，老师的课程设计和对学生的鼓励，令同学们受益匪浅。在老师的鼓励和赞赏下，最差的学生也敢开口、也能动手，同学们对课程表现得兴趣盎然。这种授课方式，锻炼了学生的阅读、听力、写作能力，对逻辑分析能力的提高也大有裨益。美国人的诚信也反映在学习上，学校要求的作业必须上交。学生的学习态度、课堂的参与度以及社会实践能力更是重中之重。如果学生考试成绩不合格，没有得到相应的学分，就必须重修并参加考试，否则会影响毕业。</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #3e3e3e; FONT-FAMILY: Helvetica; mso-bidi-font-family: Helvetica; mso-font-kerning: 0pt"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 19.2pt; TEXT-ALIGN: left; mso-pagination: widow-orphan" align=left><SPAN style="BORDER-RIGHT: windowtext 1pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 0cm; BORDER-TOP: windowtext 1pt; PADDING-LEFT: 0cm; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; BACKGROUND: #f54242; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; BORDER-LEFT: windowtext 1pt; COLOR: white; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; BORDER-BOTTOM: windowtext 1pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: Helvetica; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: inherit; mso-hansi-font-family: inherit; mso-border-alt: none windowtext 0cm">感受三：</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="BORDER-RIGHT: windowtext 1pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 0cm; BORDER-TOP: windowtext 1pt; PADDING-LEFT: 0cm; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; BACKGROUND: #f54242; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; BORDER-LEFT: windowtext 1pt; COLOR: white; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; BORDER-BOTTOM: windowtext 1pt; FONT-FAMILY: inherit; mso-bidi-font-family: Helvetica; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-border-alt: none windowtext 0cm"><FONT face=Calibri>“</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="BORDER-RIGHT: windowtext 1pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 0cm; BORDER-TOP: windowtext 1pt; PADDING-LEFT: 0cm; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; BACKGROUND: #f54242; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; BORDER-LEFT: windowtext 1pt; COLOR: white; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; BORDER-BOTTOM: windowtext 1pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: Helvetica; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: inherit; mso-hansi-font-family: inherit; mso-border-alt: none windowtext 0cm">丰富的课程，锤炼学生个性</SPAN><FONT face=Calibri><SPAN lang=EN-US style="BORDER-RIGHT: windowtext 1pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 0cm; BORDER-TOP: windowtext 1pt; PADDING-LEFT: 0cm; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; BACKGROUND: #f54242; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; BORDER-LEFT: windowtext 1pt; COLOR: white; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; BORDER-BOTTOM: windowtext 1pt; FONT-FAMILY: inherit; mso-bidi-font-family: Helvetica; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-border-alt: none windowtext 0cm">”</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #3e3e3e; FONT-FAMILY: Helvetica; mso-bidi-font-family: Helvetica; mso-font-kerning: 0pt"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 19.2pt; TEXT-ALIGN: left; mso-pagination: widow-orphan" align=left><FONT size=3><SPAN lang=EN-US style="COLOR: #3e3e3e; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; mso-bidi-font-family: Helvetica; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 宋体"><FONT face=Calibri> </FONT></SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="COLOR: #3e3e3e; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; mso-bidi-font-family: Helvetica; mso-font-kerning: 0pt"><SPAN style="mso-spacerun: yes">    </SPAN></SPAN><SPAN style="COLOR: #3e3e3e; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; mso-bidi-font-family: Helvetica; mso-font-kerning: 0pt">加菲尔德高中有丰富的课程设置，将学术培养贯穿于学校教学中，以此修炼学生的个性，加强道德修养。学校设置了数学、英语文学、历史学科、西班牙语、统计学、环境科学、微积分、物理、力学、美国历史、代数等学术类课程及各类社会实践课和内容丰富的艺术类课程。学生们以饱满的热情投入到充满乐趣的学习中，他们飞快地适应美国课堂的学习节奏，并在挑战自我的过程中收获了自信。</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #3e3e3e; FONT-FAMILY: Helvetica; mso-bidi-font-family: Helvetica; mso-font-kerning: 0pt"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 19.2pt; TEXT-ALIGN: left; mso-pagination: widow-orphan" align=left><SPAN style="BORDER-RIGHT: windowtext 1pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 0cm; BORDER-TOP: windowtext 1pt; PADDING-LEFT: 0cm; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; BACKGROUND: #f54242; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; BORDER-LEFT: windowtext 1pt; COLOR: white; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; BORDER-BOTTOM: windowtext 1pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: Helvetica; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: inherit; mso-hansi-font-family: inherit; mso-border-alt: none windowtext 0cm">感受四：</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="BORDER-RIGHT: windowtext 1pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 0cm; BORDER-TOP: windowtext 1pt; PADDING-LEFT: 0cm; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; BACKGROUND: #f54242; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; BORDER-LEFT: windowtext 1pt; COLOR: white; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; BORDER-BOTTOM: windowtext 1pt; FONT-FAMILY: inherit; mso-bidi-font-family: Helvetica; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-border-alt: none windowtext 0cm"><FONT face=Calibri>“</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="BORDER-RIGHT: windowtext 1pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 0cm; BORDER-TOP: windowtext 1pt; PADDING-LEFT: 0cm; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; BACKGROUND: #f54242; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; BORDER-LEFT: windowtext 1pt; COLOR: white; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; BORDER-BOTTOM: windowtext 1pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: Helvetica; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: inherit; mso-hansi-font-family: inherit; mso-border-alt: none windowtext 0cm">重视运动，超越自我</SPAN><FONT face=Calibri><SPAN lang=EN-US style="BORDER-RIGHT: windowtext 1pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 0cm; BORDER-TOP: windowtext 1pt; PADDING-LEFT: 0cm; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; BACKGROUND: #f54242; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; BORDER-LEFT: windowtext 1pt; COLOR: white; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; BORDER-BOTTOM: windowtext 1pt; FONT-FAMILY: inherit; mso-bidi-font-family: Helvetica; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-border-alt: none windowtext 0cm">”</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #3e3e3e; FONT-FAMILY: Helvetica; mso-bidi-font-family: Helvetica; mso-font-kerning: 0pt"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 19.2pt; TEXT-ALIGN: left; mso-pagination: widow-orphan" align=left><FONT size=3><SPAN lang=EN-US style="COLOR: #3e3e3e; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; mso-bidi-font-family: Helvetica; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 宋体"><FONT face=Calibri> </FONT></SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="COLOR: #3e3e3e; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; mso-bidi-font-family: Helvetica; mso-font-kerning: 0pt"><SPAN style="mso-spacerun: yes">    </SPAN></SPAN><SPAN style="COLOR: #3e3e3e; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; mso-bidi-font-family: Helvetica; mso-font-kerning: 0pt">加菲尔德高中非常重视学生的体育锻炼，鼓励学生在运动中不断超越自我、追求卓越。学校开设了丰富多彩的体育课程，如篮球、橄榄球、网球、足球、曲棍球、垒球、壁球、军事五项等项目。经过一天紧张而有序的课程，每天下午<SPAN lang=EN-US>3:00</SPAN>以后学生们就去参加各自的运动项目。由于学校开设的体育项目种类繁多，学生们总能找到自己喜欢的运动。在这次访学活动中，校方给我们安排了一节篮球课，并和美国学生开展了一场精彩的篮球比赛。体育运动强健学生体魄，培养竞争意识，并将学生培养成纪律严明、行规守矩的具有运动精神和团队合作精神的个体，使学生们在运动中实现自我、挑战自我、超越自我。</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #3e3e3e; FONT-FAMILY: Helvetica; mso-bidi-font-family: Helvetica; mso-font-kerning: 0pt"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 19.2pt; TEXT-ALIGN: left; mso-pagination: widow-orphan" align=left><FONT size=3><SPAN lang=EN-US style="COLOR: #3e3e3e; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; mso-bidi-font-family: Helvetica; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 宋体"><FONT face=Calibri> </FONT></SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="COLOR: #3e3e3e; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; mso-bidi-font-family: Helvetica; mso-font-kerning: 0pt"><SPAN style="mso-spacerun: yes">    </SPAN></SPAN><SPAN style="COLOR: #3e3e3e; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; mso-bidi-font-family: Helvetica; mso-font-kerning: 0pt">这次交流访学活动，让我们感受到了美式教育自由开放充满活力的风采，开阔了我们的国际视野，同时也促进了两个友好学校师生间对彼此的了解和友谊。这十二天访学中的欢笑与感动将会给我们留下不可磨灭的记忆。两校的友好交流，也进入了新的篇章。</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #3e3e3e; FONT-FAMILY: Helvetica; mso-bidi-font-family: Helvetica; mso-font-kerning: 0pt"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></P>
